WEBVTT

00:07:27.401 --> 00:07:30.029
thinking perhaps of becoming a paralegal.

00:07:30.029 --> 00:07:34.492
And then I completed a program
on dispute resolution.

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:37.578
It all went nowhere.

00:07:39.246 --> 00:07:40.998
I love to write.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:45.711
So I created a program
called Getting Started on Your Memoirs.

00:07:46.212 --> 00:07:50.841
That program has met
with "limited success."

00:07:50.841 --> 00:07:52.009
(Laughter)

00:07:52.551 --> 00:07:54.929
It's been a rocky road for me, too.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.805
And I told you to buckle up.

00:07:56.847 --> 00:07:57.932
(Laughter)

00:07:57.973 --> 00:08:00.309
Now, I know all this can sound bad.